# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Profile and data folders: never commit these.
# Tandem keeps all of its data in %APPDATA%\Tandem and %LOCALAPPDATA%\Tandem,
# outside the repository. The patterns below are a safety net in case a
# profile folder, a Claude data folder or Tandem's own data ever ends up
# inside the working tree.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/Profiles/
/profiles/
/data/
/logs/
profiles.json
profiles.*.json
settings.json
state.json
*.log

